flowchart TD
    Create["Create pending job<br/>tenant · cluster · incident scope"] --> Claim["Atomic claim<br/>owner · lease · attempt"]
    Claim --> Run["Run investigation or remediation<br/>heartbeat renews lease"]
    Run --> Result{"Outcome"}
    Result -->|success| Complete["COMPLETED"]
    Result -->|partial result| Degraded["DEGRADED"]
    Result -->|retryable and attempts remain| Retry["PENDING with backoff"]
    Retry --> Claim
    Result -->|attempts exhausted| Dead["DEAD_LETTER"]
    Result -->|cancel requested| Cancel["CANCELLED"]
    Result -->|terminal failure| Failed["FAILED"]

    style Claim fill:#f3e5f5
    style Complete fill:#e8f5e9
    style Dead fill:#ffebee
    style Cancel fill:#fff3e0
